# Trivy ignore list for the shopping-copilot image — vendored, build-time-only false positives.
#
# CVE-2026-24049 (wheel <0.46.2) and CVE-2026-23949 (jaraco.context <6.1.0) are reported
# against copies VENDORED inside setuptools' build tooling:
#   usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/setuptools/_vendor/wheel-0.45.1.dist-info
#   usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/setuptools/_vendor/jaraco.context-5.3.0.dist-info
# setuptools is a build tool and is never imported on the FastAPI runtime path, so these
# bundled copies are not reachable at runtime. The standalone runtime packages ARE patched
# (requirements.txt pins + the Dockerfile upgrade of wheel/jaraco.context).
#
# Re-review if the base image (python:3.11-slim) bumps its vendored setuptools.
CVE-2026-24049
CVE-2026-23949
